      "writtenOn": "2022-11-18T23:20:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is how our developer website announces to others.\n```\nMonaural (0) / Binaural (1). Indicates whether the device is stand-alone and receives mono data, or if the device is part of a set.\n```\nref: https://source.android.com/docs/core/connect/bluetooth/asha#devicecapabilities\n\nCould @yuyangh@google.com help to confirm is our ASHA is BINAURAL single channel or BINAURAL two channels?",
